            "published_at": "2008-10-01",
            "comment": "If the exiled card is an Aura, that card\u2019s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\u2019t target anything, but the Aura\u2019s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\u2019t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled forever."
          },
