            "object": "ruling",
            "oracle_id": "bd9b9772-f5f9-4c6b-913e-7193bea5d0a7",
            "source": "wotc",
            "published_at": "2007-10-01",
            "comment": "If there are no nonland permanents on the battlefield other than an Oblivion Ring, and the card it exiled was another Oblivion Ring, casting a third Oblivion Ring will result in an involuntary infinite loop that will end the game in a draw (unless someone chooses to break it by putting another nonland permanent onto the battlefield or destroying one of the Oblivion Rings, for example)."
          }
